<title>UK: London gold fixes just down after silver sell off.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes just down after silver sell off.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $318.75 vs $319.50 previously. Influenced by fund selling of silver late in New York. Likely to remain in range. Long term still bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Disappointed after failing again on upside.</p>
<p>$4.21/$4.23 vs $4.29/$4.31 close.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Light selling. $403.00/$406.00, off $2.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Just easier at $173.00/$176.00, down $0.75.</p>
</text>
